 "title": "The Pale Crown",
 "kind": "war",
 "seed": 6010,
 "max_tier": 8,
 "ai": "normal",
 "intro": [
  "Two broods of the Host hold the burning tunnels: Skarn Ashborn's Burrow-Host in the north and the brood of Ithra Sootveil, his warlock, in the south. Between them and the Regent lies the Barrow Below and the Barrow Gate, which the Host has taken for its own.",
  "Tier 8 is open: the rotwing leviathan. The broods do not trust each other and will fight each other as readily as you. Whoever you won over on the way may come to the crowning.",
  "Take the Barrow Gate, then burn both broods out of the dead's country."
 ],
 "outro": [
  {
   "if": {
    "flag": "hesk_knelt"
   },
   "text": [
    "The last Ashen fire in the Barrow Below goes out. Ysmay Vane climbs her mound in Sallowmere and is crowned under the red sky by the dead of three hundred years. Lady Hesk sets the crown on her head, because somebody has to and Morrow would not.",
    "The living of the south do not come to stop her. The southern marches are a kingdom of the dead now.",
    "Orrin's debt to the Regent is paid. He takes his sword and walks north toward Greyhold, to find his great-grandson. He knows something about how the Lockstone was made, and the boy will need to hear it."
   ]
  },
  {
